        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"eaf7bbd0-3fed-4d03-8289-061b68126329\",\"review_text\":\"you can't play unlimited songs in a day,the previous button is inaccessible,ads are like after every 2 or 3 songs,Too much Disappointment 😡😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"123d1f0d-8a1e-4b39-a20c-bf038eed4c8d\",\"review_text\":\"I just don't like that you can't play songs without having to adding it to your playlist\"},{\"review_id\":\"588fd12a-d667-49d1-85dc-f9a1817d2f4f\",\"review_text\":\"This app is very beautiful ❤️👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"7c8855c8-704e-4a1d-bfc2-792488717047\",\"review_text\":\"this update ruined this app even more, it had ads every two songs and it didnt have my favourite songs and lyrics never even load properly for most songs and now i cant even listen to a specific part of a song, go back to a song or control my next song at all!\"},{\"review_id\":\"ff91b91b-1a9c-4391-b4a2-d45200e746c7\",\"review_text\":\"Even lyrics are premium 😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"e64f8c69-388e-4c59-ab85-704aa371cca4\",\"review_text\":\"really to much ads ..and this is really annoying\"},{\"review_id\":\"375799e5-a702-428a-a11f-c3f517529544\",\"review_text\":\"Wonderful app🥰🥰👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"ecea523d-9f04-44ec-83ee-cff354ec6b8f\",\"review_text\":\"🤦\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9a6e521-19c9-4470-8e33-da511cb066b1\",\"review_text\":\"... Then guided to uninstall old app. . Now I cannot download anything unless I upgrade (yep, spend some bucks) which I do not plan on doing. I will #uninstall unless someone corrects this SOON. I smell #Pandora in my future... Or #Slacker.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9dceb23-ea5e-4274-ab11-29f8b85ef406\",\"review_text\":\"Super songs lyics also super\"}]}"
